WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.670
Latent Introspection

00:00:01.824 --> 00:00:03.239
a Qwen 32B

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.276
model can detect

00:00:04.088 --> 00:00:05.385
injected concepts

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:06.983
A paper finds

00:00:06.794 --> 00:00:07.985
that Qwen 32B

00:00:07.797 --> 00:00:08.704
detects when a

00:00:08.516 --> 00:00:10.001
concept was injected

00:00:09.813 --> 00:00:10.768
into its earlier

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:11.381
context

00:00:11.606 --> 00:00:12.773
logit lens shows

00:00:12.585 --> 00:00:13.457
the signal in

00:00:13.268 --> 00:00:14.494
the residual stream

00:00:14.377 --> 00:00:15.485
even while sampled

00:00:15.297 --> 00:00:16.558
answers deny it

00:00:17.086 --> 00:00:18.041
Telling the model

00:00:17.852 --> 00:00:19.161
accurately how AI

00:00:18.973 --> 00:00:20.187
introspection works

00:00:19.999 --> 00:00:21.225
raises sensitivity

00:00:21.036 --> 00:00:22.215
to injection from

00:00:22.027 --> 00:00:25.352
0.3% to 39.9%

00:00:25.529 --> 00:00:26.343
with only a

00:00:26.154 --> 00:00:28.347
0.6% rise in

00:00:28.159 --> 00:00:29.314
false positives

00:00:29.846 --> 00:00:31.166
Mutual information

00:00:30.978 --> 00:00:32.416
between nine injected

00:00:32.228 --> 00:00:33.607
and recovered concepts

00:00:33.513 --> 00:00:35.541
goes from 0.61

00:00:35.353 --> 00:00:37.133
to 1.05 bits

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.195
which the authors

00:00:38.006 --> 00:00:39.103
say rules out

00:00:38.914 --> 00:00:40.117
generic noise

00:00:40.638 --> 00:00:41.652
Full story on

00:00:41.463 --> 00:00:42.359
the dashboard
